## Case Evidence and Ground Truth

The evidence files in `audit_bench/cases/*/evidence/` are abridged excerpts of public financial filings, regulatory documents, and press reports. They are factual records of public information and are not subject to copyright claims by the repository author. The ground truth files (`audit_bench/cases/*/ground_truth.json`) are original analytical work by the author and are licensed under CC BY 4.0.

